cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Derailment in your teaching or research, please cite it
  using this metadata.
title: >-
  Derailment — a harness for inducing and measuring
  psychopathology-like cognitive distortions in LLMs
type: software
authors:
  - name: Derailment contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-28"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Derailment emulates psychopathology-like cognitive distortions in
  language models by manipulating attention, salience, valence and
  arousal through a layered pipeline, and measures the induced behavior
  against a healthy baseline with eighteen instruments and 0-3 symptom
  scales. Emulation, not diagnosis.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - psychopathology
  - cognitive distortion
  - evaluation harness
  - standardized patient
  - chaos engineering
